        "original_id": "af272870-3a9c-5b27-b136-404452aa5cc3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Sinclair Research, Westminster Mail Order Ltd, Sinclair Instrument Ltd, Science of Cambridge Ltd, Sinclair Computers Ltd\n- People: Clive Sinclair\n- Products: Wave Mate Bullet\n- Systems: Z80, CP/M\n- Places: Cambridge\n\nFacts:\n- Sinclair Research was originally incorporated in 1973 as Westminster Mail Order Ltd.\n- The company later changed its name from Westminster Mail Order Ltd to Sinclair Instrument Ltd, then to Science of Cambridge Ltd, then to Sinclair Computers Ltd.\n- In 1975, Sinclair Computers Ltd was renamed Sinclair Research Ltd.\n- Clive Sinclair founded Sinclair Research Ltd in Cambridge.\n- Sinclair Research Ltd is a British consumer electronics company.\n- The Wave Mate Bullet was a Z80 single-board computer from the late 1970s and early 1980s.\n- The Wave Mate Bullet used the CP/M operating system.",
